WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.247 --> 00:00:17.608
bank is being robbed now?"

2
00:00:18.008 --> 00:00:18.669
asked Roxy.

3
00:00:18.689 --> 00:00:22.531
"Metro City Central Bank," said Detective Smith.

4
00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:26.913
"We have to hurry—Rocket Girl?"

5
00:00:29.514 --> 00:00:32.356
A minute later Roxy was outside Metro City Central Bank.

6
00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:35.509
It was a large building in downtown Metro City.

7
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.289
It was at the top of a long, steep hill.

8
00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.371
Inside the bank Roxy could see people running around and crying out.

9
00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:48.092
"He's shooting freeze rays!"

10
00:00:48.112 --> 00:00:51.353
"I'm so cold!"

11
00:00:51.373 --> 00:00:54.094
"Save us, Rocket Girl!"

12
00:00:55.034 --> 00:00:56.074
Roxy saw the villain.

13
00:00:57.274 --> 00:00:59.595
He was wearing silver boots and a white jumpsuit.

14
00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:02.676
Icicles hung from his silver beard.

15
00:01:03.692 --> 00:01:04.993
"It's Freddie Freeze!"

16
00:01:05.453 --> 00:01:06.073
said Roxy.

17
00:01:07.294 --> 00:01:09.275
Freddie was holding a Big Freeze Blaster.

18
00:01:10.176 --> 00:01:12.397
It was attached to a large tank on Freddie's back.

19
00:01:13.738 --> 00:01:15.379
He was walking toward the bank's safe.

20
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.461
Roxy used her x-ray vision to look in the tank.

21
00:01:21.782 --> 00:01:22.983
It was filled with ice cream.

22
00:01:23.003 --> 00:01:26.865
"Aha!" Roxy realized.

23
00:01:26.885 --> 00:01:31.848
"Freddie Freeze is using the ice cream to power his Big Freeze Blaster!"

24
00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:34.145
Roxy flew into the bank.

25
00:01:34.165 --> 00:01:38.128
"Hold it right there, Freddie!"

26
00:01:38.508 --> 00:01:39.068
she shouted.

27
00:01:39.088 --> 00:01:41.750
"Your bank-robbing days are over!"

28
00:01:42.711 --> 00:01:44.392
Freddie Freeze quickly turned around.

29
00:01:45.232 --> 00:01:46.874
His eyes widened in surprise.

30
00:01:48.275 --> 00:01:49.415
"Rocket Girl!"

31
00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:50.256
he said.

32
00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:52.457
"You'll never stop me!"

33
00:01:53.538 --> 00:01:55.399
Freddie blasted a freeze ray at Roxy.

34
00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.082
Fwoosh! Roxy jumped out of the way and ran back outside.

35
00:02:00.943 --> 00:02:01.744
Freddie followed her.

36
00:02:05.044 --> 00:02:06.706
Roxy ran partway down the hill.

37
00:02:06.726 --> 00:02:11.570
"I'm going to turn you into an ice pop!"

38
00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:12.671
shouted Freddie.

39
00:02:13.571 --> 00:02:17.535
Fwoosh! The tree next to Roxy was frozen solid.

40
00:02:18.716 --> 00:02:19.877
"You'll never hit me!"

41
00:02:20.317 --> 00:02:20.958
said Roxy.

42
00:02:20.978 --> 00:02:22.599
"You're too slow!"

43
00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:26.202
Freddie Freeze shot blast after blast of freeze rays.

44
00:02:28.004 --> 00:02:30.265
Roxy darted back and forth and up and down.

45
00:02:31.486 --> 00:02:35.244
She was much too quick for Freddie.

46
00:02:35.304 --> 00:02:37.505
"Just give up, Freddie," said Roxy.

47
00:02:37.525 --> 00:02:41.028
"I'm too fast for your dumb freeze rays."

48
00:02:42.368 --> 00:02:44.330
Roxy was now standing at the edge of the hill.

49
00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.892
Freddie aimed his Big Freeze Blaster and fired at her.

50
00:02:47.912 --> 00:02:51.034
Fwoosh! Roxy jumped.

51
00:02:52.114 --> 00:02:53.655
"Ha-ha!" Roxy laughed.

52
00:02:53.675 --> 00:02:55.716
"You missed me again!

53
00:02:55.736 --> 00:03:01.500
Whoa!" Freddie's last freeze ray had frozen the entire street.

54
00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:05.531
It was a long, steep hill, and Roxy was sliding fast!

55
00:03:05.551 --> 00:03:08.714
"Whoa!" cried Roxy.

56
00:03:09.995 --> 00:03:12.057
Roxy tried to melt the ice with her heat vision.

57
00:03:12.857 --> 00:03:15.820
But she was sliding too fast and spinning all over the place.

58
00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:20.083
Looking up, she could see Freddie aiming his Big Freeze Blaster at her.

59
00:03:22.946 --> 00:03:23.686
Roxy gulped.

60
00:03:23.706 --> 00:03:25.208
"Uh-oh!"
